Subject: [PATCH] ath11k: bind WMI key completions and abort unresolved installs

Match pending wire identities, arbitrate replies and faults under base_lock,
and fail recovery wakes explicitly. Keep unresolved channels poisoned for
the base lifetime because completions carry no cookie. Drain callers and
RCU callbacks before ar free. Detach host key ownership when deletion fails,
including pinned retired peers, and expose numeric state without key bytes.
Same-tuple duplicates after success remain a firmware protocol ambiguity.

